  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Support to Palestinian Refugees(UKSPR) 2022-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide predictable, multi-year funding to the United Nations Relief and Works Agency for Palestinian refugees in the Near East which will help the Agency deliver basic education including to girls, health services including family planning, vaccines and pre-natal and anti-natal services, relief services and humanitarian aid to more than 5.9 million Palestinian refugees in Gaza, the West Bank, Jordan, Lebanon and Syria.</narrative>
  </description>
